    "body": "1. URL's path starts out as a list: https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-path\n2. The only case where path is directly set to a different type is https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-concept-url-path⑤ (scheme state, 2.9)\n3. That case is not applicable here since remaining starts with `/`",
